WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.465
Orion, the hunter.

00:02.250 --> 00:10.085
Three stars in a row and four more around them: the easiest figure in the sky to find, and one that both halves of the world can see.

00:10.575 --> 00:12.105
The Greeks drew a hunter here.

00:12.648 --> 00:18.870
In Egypt it was the god Osiris, and across Latin America the three belt stars are the Three Marys.
